-Anthracite_nur60-an","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-nur60-an","label":"Matte Anthracite"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Nur-60---Matte-Lemon_nur60-ml","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-nur60-ml","label":"Matte Lemon"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Nur-60---Matte-Mauve_nur60-mm","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-nur60-mm","label":"Matte Mauve"},{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/Nur-60---Matte-Laguna_nur60-la","selected":false,"targetId":"sku-nur60-la","label":"Matte Laguna"}],"tapHoles":[{"url":"https://studiobagno.com.au/product/nur-60---matte-grey_nur60-gr","label":"0","selected":true,"targetId":"sku-nur60-gr"}]},"descriptionHtml":"<div><div><div>The Nur 60 seamlessly weaves into the aesthetic harmony of our signature <a href=\"https://www.studiobagno.com.au/collection-organic\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Collection Organic</b></a>. The basin features a beautiful inward curve, a feat of traditional Italian handmade ceramics that neglects any intricate, harsh lines, and welcomes a modern softness.</div><div>The basin works as a striking centerpiece on any bathroom bench, giving the illusion of weightlessness through its softened contours above a subtle skirt. Evoking a feeling of serenity, the piece pairs perfectly with the minimalism of the entire collection, creating a cohesive design narrative across any bathroom, especially when paired with the Milady Toilet range and Nur Bath from Collection Organic.</div><div>The basin is available in matte white, matte black and the colours of our Alice Palette</div><div>Handmade in Italy.</div></div><div><b>Notes: </b>32mm non-overflow plug &amp; waste not included.</div><div><b>Recommended Plug &amp; Waste:<a href=\"#/product/sku-sbw006-gr\">SBW006/GR</a></b><br/></div></div>","sourceRecordCount":1,"captureDate":"2026-11-01","availability":null}
